Z||000000||8Ball||12-02-2001||07:50 PM||||Ok well as some of you know I am going to be painting my car befor long (hopefully) But I decided I want to make a few mods befor I do. Which of coarse sets back a paint date. But the main one is a functional yet differant rear scoop. I was going to put on one of pat's scoops but everyone is getting those. And like I said it has to be differant. Does anyone know what the ls/88 scoop would look like on the rear decklid? Maybe an edited pic of one on a notchback. The rear decklid if I remember correctly has a useable space for a scoop of 39x30 inches. So the ls/88 would have to be trimmed down a little but not much. Any ideas or examples?<P>The scoop I am looking at is at <A HREF="http://www.aeroglass.com/scoops/corvette.php" TARGET=_blank>http://www.aeroglass.com/scoops/corvette.php</A> <P>Thanks gang for any input.<BR>E.B.<P>P.S. Yes I want a scoop the full length of the deck lid  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by 8Ball (edited 12-02-2001).]||||reg||5
